{
  "lang": "en",
  "film": "The Great Dictator",
  "source_rel": "Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 1_有史以来最伟大的表演独白 PART 1/Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 1_有史以来最伟大的表演独白 PART 1.mp4",
  "t_start_global": 949.42,
  "t_end_global": 1111.66,
  "duration": 162.24,
  "clip": "The Great Dictator.mp4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.26,
      "text": "I'm sorry, but I don't want to be an emperor.",
      "filename": "segment001.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 3.66,
      "end": 4.66,
      "text": "That's not my business.",
      "filename": "segment002.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 5.56,
      "end": 7.58,
      "text": "I don't want to rule or conquer anyone.",
      "filename": "segment003.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 8.1,
      "end": 9.84,
      "text": "I should like to help everyone if possible.",
      "filename": "segment004.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 10.24,
      "end": 12.64,
      "text": "Jew, gentile, black man, white.",
      "filename": "segment005.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 13.46,
      "end": 14.78,
      "text": "We all want to help one another.",
      "filename": "segment006.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 15.1,
      "end": 16.3,
      "text": "Human beings are like that.",
      "filename": "segment007.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 16.78,
      "end": 19.18,
      "text": "We want to live by each other's happiness, not by each other's misery.",
      "filename": "segment008.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 19.82,
      "end": 21.78,
      "text": "We don't want to hate and despise one another.",
      "filename": "segment009.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 22.4,
      "end": 25.1,
      "text": "In this world, there's room for everyone, and the good earth is rich,",
      "filename": "segment010.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 25.64,
      "end": 27.7,
      "text": "and can provide for everyone the wealth and the glory.",
      "filename": "segment011.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 27.72,
      "end": 29.5,
      "text": "The way of life can be free and beautiful,",
      "filename": "segment012.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 30.22,
      "end": 31.6,
      "text": "but we have lost the way.",
      "filename": "segment013.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 32.54,
      "end": 34.5,
      "text": "Greed has poisoned men's souls,",
      "filename": "segment014.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 35.09,
      "end": 36.8,
      "text": "has barricaded the world with hate,",
      "filename": "segment015.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 37.2,
      "end": 39.54,
      "text": "has goose-stepped us into misery and bloodshed.",
      "filename": "segment016.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 40.06,
      "end": 43.04,
      "text": "We have developed speed, but we have shut ourselves in.",
      "filename": "segment017.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 43.62,
      "end": 45.9,
      "text": "Machinery that gives abundance has left us in want.",
      "filename": "segment018.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 46.44,
      "end": 49.76,
      "text": "Our knowledge has made us cynical, our cleverness hard and unkind.",
      "filename": "segment019.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 50.26,
      "end": 52.52,
      "text": "We think too much and feel too little.",
      "filename": "segment020.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 53.18,
      "end": 55.34,
      "text": "More than machinery, we need humanity.",
      "filename": "segment021.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 55.34,
      "end": 58.76,
      "text": "More than cleverness, we need kindness and gentleness.",
      "filename": "segment022.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 59.42,
      "end": 62.78,
      "text": "Without these qualities, life will be violent, and all will be lost.",
      "filename": "segment023.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 63.46,
      "end": 65.78,
      "text": "The aeroplane and the radio have brought us closer together.",
      "filename": "segment024.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 66.2,
      "end": 68.96,
      "text": "The very nature of these inventions cries out for the goodness in men,",
      "filename": "segment025.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 69.38,
      "end": 72.1,
      "text": "cries out for universal brotherhood, for the unity of us all.",
      "filename": "segment026.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 72.62,
      "end": 75.159,
      "text": "Even now, my voice is reaching millions throughout the world.",
      "filename": "segment027.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 75.679,
      "end": 77.84,
      "text": "Millions of despairing men, women, and children,",
      "filename": "segment028.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 78.52,
      "end": 82.38,
      "text": "victims of a system that makes men torture and imprison innocent people.",
      "filename": "segment029.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 83.24,
      "end": 86.34,
      "text": "To those who can hear me, I say, do not despair.",
      "filename": "segment030.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 86.88,
      "end": 89.72,
      "text": "The misery that is now upon us is but the passing of greed,",
      "filename": "segment031.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 90.1,
      "end": 93.159,
      "text": "the bitterness of men who fear the way of human progress.",
      "filename": "segment032.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 93.74,
      "end": 96.64,
      "text": "The hate of men will pass, and dictators die.",
      "filename": "segment033.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 96.919,
      "end": 100.1,
      "text": "And the power they took from the people will return to the people.",
      "filename": "segment034.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 100.4,
      "end": 103.5,
      "text": "And so long as men die, liberty will never perish.",
      "filename": "segment035.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 105.56,
      "end": 107.58,
      "text": "Soldiers, don't give yourselves to brutes.",
      "filename": "segment036.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 108.14,
      "end": 111.38,
      "text": "Men who despise you, enslave you, who regiment your lives,",
      "filename": "segment037.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 111.38,
      "end": 113.52,
      "text": "tell you what to do, what to think, and what to feel,",
      "filename": "segment038.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 113.82,
      "end": 117.66,
      "text": "who drill you, diet you, treat you like cattle, use you as cannon fodder.",
      "filename": "segment039.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 118.1,
      "end": 120.36,
      "text": "Don't give yourselves to these unnatural men,",
      "filename": "segment040.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 120.84,
      "end": 123.74,
      "text": "machine men with machine minds and machine hearts.",
      "filename": "segment041.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 124.2,
      "end": 127.44,
      "text": "You are not machines. You are not cattle. You are men.",
      "filename": "segment042.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 127.94,
      "end": 129.82,
      "text": "You have the love of humanity in your hearts.",
      "filename": "segment043.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 130.16,
      "end": 132.22,
      "text": "You don't hate. Only the unloved hate.",
      "filename": "segment044.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 132.58,
      "end": 133.82,
      "text": "The unloved and the unnatural.",
      "filename": "segment045.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 134.56,
      "end": 137.34,
      "text": "Soldiers, don't fight for slavery. Fight for liberty.",
      "filename": "segment046.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 137.34,
      "end": 139.66,
      "text": "In the 17th chapter of St. Luke it is written,",
      "filename": "segment047.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 139.94,
      "end": 143.24,
      "text": "the kingdom of God is within man, not one man nor a group of men,",
      "filename": "segment048.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 143.42,
      "end": 146.8,
      "text": "but in all men, in you. You, the people, have the power.",
      "filename": "segment049.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 147.12,
      "end": 149.7,
      "text": "The power to create machines. The power to create happiness.",
      "filename": "segment050.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 150.12,
      "end": 153.14,
      "text": "You, the people, have the power to make this life free and beautiful,",
      "filename": "segment051.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 153.48,
      "end": 155.38,
      "text": "to make this life a wonderful adventure.",
      "filename": "segment052.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 155.84,
      "end": 158.68,
      "text": "Then in the name of democracy, let us use that power.",
      "filename": "segment053.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 158.96,
      "end": 162.24,
      "text": "Let us all unite. Let us fight for a new world,",
      "filename": "segment054.mp4"
    }
  ]
}